ENTRY            M0158   20261016   20261127   20261127       M149
SUBENT        M0158001   20261016   20261127   20261127       M149
BIB                 13         34
TITLE      Partial nucleon channels of Na-23 dipole giant
            resonance decay.
AUTHOR     (A.S.Gabelko,K.M.Irgashev,B.S.Ishkhanov,I.M.Kapitonov,
            V.I.Mokeev,I.M.Piskarev)
REFERENCE  (J,SNP,44,741,1986)
            Eng.trans.of YF,44,(5),1145,1986
           (J,YF,44,1145,1986)
INSTITUTE  (4RUSMOS)
FACILITY   (BETAT,4RUSMOS)
INC-SOURCE (BRST)
METHOD     (EXTB,SITA)
DETECTOR   (GELI)
PART-DET   (G) Gamma detection at 140 deg.
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-S) Statistical errors given.
COMMENT    A new method for determining integral partial cross
            sections of photonuclear reactions in (gamma,xgamma')
            experiments was applied to studying partial channels
            of Na-23 GDR decay. Integral partial cross sections
            obtained for 20 deg decay channels which have been
            observed before. Contributions were found introduced
            by semidirect processes to the mechanisms of Na-23
            dipole photoabsorption.
STATUS     (APRVD) by A.S.Gabelko.
HISTORY    (19870227C)
           (19890228T)
           (19910202A) Corrected by V.Varlamov, V.Mclane
           (20121102A) SD: Updated to new date formats,lower case.
                Corrected according last EXFOR rules and Dict.
                Ref. on transl. was added.
                       VV: STATUS, REACTION code in SUBENTs
                002 - 003 was corrected.
           (20220131U) Corrected by V.Varlamov: STATUS.
           (20261016A) Corrected by V.Varlamov: REFERENCE,
            PART-DET, REACTION, DATA, STATUS.
ENDBIB              34
COMMON               2          3
ANG        EN-MAX
